[
  {
    "id": 2007006110010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──女王陛下の、おなーりー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bg": "00124",
    "bgm": "0000",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110010"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0243",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分で言うのか",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "3000070050",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "015"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……あららん？　Ｐたぁん\r\n陛下に向かってその口のきき方はないんじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ハートの女王、なんていつもと違うイメージの役でも、\r\nソツなくこなせちゃう陛下なんだけどなー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "難しい撮影でも巻きで進めちゃう、\r\nデキる陛下なんだけどなー？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華にハートの女王はハマり役だと思ってるんだけど──\r\nっていうのは一旦おいといて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……これは失礼いたしました、女王陛下\r\nわたくしの無礼をどうぞお許しください",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "陛下を敬う気持ちに偽りはないのです\r\n信じていただけないでしょうか？",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうだろう、\r\nこれで機嫌を直してもらえないか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あははっ、よろしい！\r\n柔軟な対応に免じて、今回は特別に許す！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "た・だ・し──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "女王はひとりでは休憩時間を持て余してしまいます\r\n簡単に言うと退屈してしまいそうです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "女王を退屈させるなんて──\r\n罪なことだとは思いません？",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……陛下は何をお望みですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ええ、ええ！\r\n察しのいい者は嫌いじゃありませんよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "しかし、すべての答えをこちらに求めようなどとは怠慢です\r\nあなたは女王の手を煩わせるつもりですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "私が喜ぶ答えを、\r\nあなたが考えて見つけてくれなくては",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほど？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──さぁ、大いに悩みなさい！\r\n首を刎ねられたくなければね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーと……\r\n──では陛下、ティータイムなどはいかがでしょう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こういった場所です、休憩用に\r\nよい茶葉や洋菓子が用意されていると聞きました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "美味しいというのなら、\r\nもちろん味わってみたいものですが──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それだけじゃ足りないわ\r\n及第点とは言えません",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──第一、お茶とお菓子が美味しくたって、\r\nあなたの努力の結果とは言えないでしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……これは手厳しい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……であれば、わたくしとっておきの\r\n一発ギャグ集を──",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "却下\r\nこの場を凍らせるつもりですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そんなことより、他の案はないのですか？\r\nもうギブアップ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "申し訳ございません\r\n陛下のご期待に添うには、まだまだ勉強不足のようです",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これ以上情けない姿をお見せしてしまう前に、\r\n正解を教えていただけませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あらあら……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "さっき察しがいいと褒めたばかりなのに……\r\n困った人！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110200"
  },
