  {
    "id": 2007006110220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あなたもまだまだね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "～～～～結華っ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あははっ\r\nとってもいい暇つぶしになったよプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やっぱりプロデューサーと一緒だと、\r\n退屈なんて感じてられないね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、あーもう……\r\nだから結華は女王様なんだよな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "んー？\r\nわがまま放題の大変な女子だって言いたいのかなー？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうじゃなくて\r\nこの人を喜ばせたいって思わせる魅力があるってこと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ふぅん？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんだ……？\r\n俺は本気で言ってるんだからな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "へーえ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──じゃあ、とりあえずは",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700611/2007006110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007006110290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『咄嗟の言い訳としては上出来♡』\r\nってことにしといてあげるね、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
